      "content": "it's hard to just 'let go' though. the walls feel so thick. every time i try to be myself even a little bit, everyone pulls me back or makes me feel like i'm doing something wrong. it feels like there's no exit. like no matter what i do, i'm always going to be stuck playing this part until i'm old and dead. it's just a cycle that never stops.",
